Modifications in this demo: the rules were rewritten in TypeScript for a
single-symbol long/flat engine. A signal observed on bar t is filled at the
open of bar t+1. Costs are a fixed fee and fixed slippage. The original
Python runs a multi-name book through the QuantJourney fill engine.

The catalog figures labeled "as published by quants.md" are copied from
https://quants.md/ (snapshot 2026-11-22, results generated 2026-07-11).
They are not results produced by this demo.

Price series in public/bars.json are synthetic. They are not market data.
